Patch summary:
Give apps without a TV banner, made for phones, a banner made from their
adaptive icon, so that their cards are filled as those of TV apps are instead
of showing a small icon on a plain card. The icon, unmasked, is drawn in the
middle with the 72dp that launchers show as tall as the card, and its left and
right edges are stretched out to the card's sides. Apps whose icon is not
adaptive keep the plain card.

diff --git a/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/tv/launcher/model/LeanbackAppInfo.kt b/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/tv/launcher/model/LeanbackAppInfo.kt
--- a/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/tv/launcher/model/LeanbackAppInfo.kt
